  "title": "Brisket with BBQ Sauce",
  "description": "Beef brisket is rubbed with spices and liquid smoke, and refrigerated overnight. After roasting, covered, for 5 to 6 hours, it is sliced, sauced, and baked for another hour.",
  "authors": [
    "Cathy G"
  ],
